{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"1718867188","y":0.046511627815394085,"c":0.5,"x":0.7716049391467531,"w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"c":1,"y":0.095930232436826746,"t":"the library, there is usually at least one 'special' activity that children can do each day. For","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.10082303707892701,"w":0.66460906982421875},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.66460901896158853,"y":0.11042402824871056,"x":0.10288067948525499,"c":1,"t":"example, Spanish. We have a specialist teacher coming in every Thursday to give a basic"},{"w":0.6769547526041666,"c":1,"x":0.10082303511639566,"t":"introduction to the language through games and songs. She does two sessions: one for the","h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.12632508820680732},{"x":0.10282473523647856,"c":1,"y":0.13866295228322711,"h":0.014650930083401792,"t":"over &s and one for the younger children. This is the only activity which we have to make an","w":0.68526855468749992},{"h":0.013250883392226021,"y":0.17579505309279853,"c":1,"w":0.67901234944661459,"t":"Once a week the children have the opportunity to do some music. We're very lucky that one","x":0.10288065644067482},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"of our staff is a member of a folk band. On Mondays, she teaches singing and percussion to","y":0.19040697663787698,"x":0.10288065644953216,"w":0.67901234944661459},{"h":0.014925423162705176,"c":1,"w":0.66265482584635416,"y":0.20349418680343412,"t":"groups of children. We do rely on parental support for this, so if any of you sing or play an","x":0.10283192209407313},{"x":0.10288066588811433,"c":1,"w":0.617283935546875,"y":0.21937573602692506,"t":"instrument and would be prepared to help out at these sessions, we'd be delighted.","h":0.013250883392226243},{"w":0.66049382527669265,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.1028806592705422,"c":1,"y":0.24116607778886823,"t":"Painting continues to be one of the most popular activities. To begin with we weren't keen"},{"w":0.68312759399414069,"y":0.25436046498003761,"c":1,"t":"on offering this because of the extra mess involved, but children kept asking if they could do","x":0.10288064791180677,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"t":"some art and so we finally gave in. Art is great for helping the children to relax after working","x":0.10282427645332405,"w":0.67706181844075519,"h":0.014979209158530016,"y":0.26843293208456631},{"y":0.28224631244671827,"x":0.10255600335900325,"t":"hard at school all day.","w":0.1653509267171224,"h":0.014418215577537863,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Yoga is something that we've been meaning to introduce for some time but haven't been able","x":0.10288064639172764,"y":0.30523255803312388,"w":0.68930043538411456,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.10288064828471287,"y":0.31976744174077387,"w":0.67695475260416671,"c":1,"t":"to find anyone available to teach it - until now that is. So we'll see how this goes. Hopefully,"},{"t":"children will benefit in all sorts of ways from this.","c":1,"w":0.35802469889322919,"y":0.33421672561752191,"h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.10288065460688339},{"y":0.35600706737107102,"w":0.65226338704427078,"c":1,"x":0.10288065205399619,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"Cooking is another popular activity. They make a different sort of cake, or pizza or bread"},{"x":0.10288066458653541,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.68106994628906248,"c":1,"y":0.37063953477688438,"t":"each week. Although the younger children love doing it, we found that the mess was just too"},{"w":0.69135803222656245,"t":"much, so we ve decided to restrict this to the over 8s, as they are better able to clean up after","x":0.10288065456703341,"c":1,"y":0.38515901087315896,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"y":0.40019104871788735,"w":0.092988980611165353,"x":0.10265754845568774,"h":0.01054873988822147,"c":1,"t":"themselves."},{"y":0.1395348835624971,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q16","w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"x":0.81893004154638593},{"c":1,"x":0.81893004153995586,"t":"Q17","y":0.20494186032642436,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"t":"Q18","x":0.81893004154730453,"y":0.25436046495200615,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"Q19","x":0.81893004154638593,"y":0.30523255799870541,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"c":1,"x":0.81893004158110827,"w":0.034979422887166267,"y":0.3837209299841905,"t":"Q20","h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"PART 3","y":0.45200235585080528,"w":0.096707820892333998,"x":0.1008230441745165,"h":0.014567411690072807,"c":1},{"h":0.0072674419910803145,"t":"HOLLY:","y":0.48110465108096623,"w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.10082304536551473,"c":1},{"y":0.493840742379693,"w":0.052422587076822902,"h":0.010789392693725142,"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.10042734802227121},{"t":"HOLLY:","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.51017441850646172,"x":0.1028806583137104,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180001},{"h":0.0087209298276508251,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.52325581406873278,"x":0.10082304620406539,"w":0.051440327962239588,"c":1},{"x":0.10284250974111817,"y":0.53770536224096743,"c":1,"h":0.010345089421536224,"w":0.045343786875406883,"t":"HOLLY:"},{"t":"TUTOR:","h":0.0091907295658394395,"y":0.56662556542974385,"c":1,"w":0.049544766743977856,"x":0.10279963299087984},{"t":"HOLLY:","x":0.10263271780192004,"h":0.011335625665347848,"c":1,"w":0.04576337178548176,"y":0.59389614047561978},{"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:","w":0.049382715225219725,"x":0.10288065874541485,"y":0.62499999990346222,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"x":0.10082304536551473,"t":"HOLLY:","w":0.047325102488199877,"y":0.6395348836227408,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.66715116258930607,"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.10082304611833152,"w":0.051440327962239588,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"w":0.045267489751180029,"t":"HOLLY:","y":0.69622093011690278,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.10288065830881132,"c":1},{"t":"TUTOR:","h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.10288065939699233,"c":1,"w":0.049382715225219712,"y":0.72383720904132121},{"x":0.10080668984639062,"c":1,"t":"HOLLY:","y":0.7543159689210277,"w":0.047357813517252587,"h":0.0088099225811457682},{"h":0.0087209298276508251,"x":0.10082304620406539,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.76744186058036057,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239588},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.78343023245995014,"w":0.047325102488199877,"c":1,"x":0.10082304536551473,"t":"HOLLY:"},{"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.10288065920837779,"y":0.81104651172134901,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"w":0.049382715225219712,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.84011627895290075,"w":0.047325102488199863,"c":1,"x":0.10082304536598237,"t":"HOLLY:"},{"y":0.4776248982029645,"w":0.4898721822102865,"h":0.014594530188714483,"c":1,"t":"Hello Dr Green - I'm here to talk to you about my work placement.","x":0.19332792003048363},{"x":0.19135802356922818,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Oh yes, it's Holly, isn't it?","y":0.49411071845814591,"w":0.18724280039469401},{"c":1,"t":"Yes.","w":0.038690265019734715,"h":0.014762179730778202,"y":0.50642704969287577,"x":0.19156021733611936},{"c":1,"t":"So, which work placement have you chosen?","h":0.01309337941721278,"y":0.52179034162653604,"w":0.33539095560709631,"x":0.19341563320531738},{"t":"I decided to go for the Orion Stadium placement. The event I'Il be managing is","y":0.53621908106069571,"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.19341564278104953},{"t":"one where I'm helping to set up a sports competition for primary school children.","h":0.014444678074058248,"c":1,"w":0.59475001017252604,"y":0.55005552097448274,"x":0.19335501457834028},{"x":0.19341562641157148,"t":"Yup. That's always a popular placement - even though it can be tougher than","y":0.56537102457529276,"w":0.57407409667968745,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"t":"you think working with children.","c":1,"w":0.23868311564127606,"x":0.1893004173813129,"y":0.57979976455128002,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"y":0.59447674407926521,"w":0.5596707661946615,"c":1,"t":"I know, but it's the fresh air that attracts me - organising something indoors","x":0.19341564559908231,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"w":0.44238683064778644,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.19341563806556611,"t":"doesn't have the same appeal, even though it might be fun.","c":1,"y":0.60895170807162047},{"c":1,"t":"OK, so obviously safety's going to be one of your key concerns for this event.","y":0.62354651152130058,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.19341564372219777,"w":0.57201644897460935},{"c":1,"w":0.52068598429361979,"x":0.19334808569462855,"h":0.014552779135911909,"t":"Yes, I've already thought about that. I'Il need to make sure none of the","y":0.63659790101310276},{"w":0.17327777862548827,"c":1,"x":0.19321924961263098,"t":"equipment's damaged.","h":0.014416190283318087,"y":0.65022605391316235},{"t":"Ah well, you'll be working with schools, so the equipment will be their","y":0.66414829160250832,"w":0.51466013590494797,"h":0.017789698601892279,"c":1,"x":0.19123900388412285},{"y":0.67874798686850424,"t":"responsibility. However, the grounds and what goes on there will be yours.","x":0.19131435200970798,"c":1,"h":0.014715652443354488,"w":0.55361109415690102},{"h":0.015998922893942114,"c":1,"y":0.69326607531993389,"x":0.19130531514444102,"w":0.5824170430501302,"t":"Oh I see - that'll include keeping everyone within the boundary once they're in"},{"w":0.18312756856282553,"x":0.19341563948401935,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"y":0.70930232548424876,"t":"their kit and on the field?"},{"y":0.72379269706620286,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.19135801234035341,"w":0.58024693806966143,"c":1,"t":"Exactly - you'll need to inspect areas like changing rooms as well for anything"},{"c":1,"x":0.19127817025697338,"w":0.53309382120768234,"y":0.73688212214509452,"t":"someone can trip over, but your main priority will be not to lose anyone!","h":0.016338842636845263},{"x":0.19330331963745398,"w":0.26974667867024738,"y":0.75065320709380401,"h":0.014029270347352574,"t":"Right. I'll need staff to help with that.","c":1},{"x":0.19341563712537094,"y":0.76737338058685756,"w":0.28189300537109374,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"And don't forget about the spectators."},{"h":0.017553957949257515,"x":0.19129619806587991,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. I was thinking that many of them will be parents, who could help run the","w":0.58449142456054681,"y":0.78020519560703494},{"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"I wouldn't rely on that. They'll be more interested in filming their children than","x":0.18930040012582233,"y":0.80948174314610721,"w":0.57407409667968756,"c":1},{"t":"volunteering.","y":0.82345666695645969,"x":0.19123258691543801,"w":0.10121586481730141,"h":0.011966696335935167,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.014563987898180697,"x":0.1893004060823166,"w":0.47942387898763028,"y":0.83863368664789317,"t":"I'll need to make sure they don't interfere with events doing that!"},{"t":"Q21","x":0.81893004153995586,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.59447674404735451,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"Q22","x":0.81893004177638429,"y":0.69331395324000444,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"t":"109","y":0.86773255798110183,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.8456790129620837},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","c":1,"h":0.035065240938615738,"w":0.30625673929850261,"x":0.66985399407639135,"y":0.95318838516407633}],"h":3395}